OL,3,GNEWSAI had 11 years of chemotherapy for
OL,4,Aa cancer I didn't have
OL,5,
OL,6,FBecky Jones was just 21 when she was
OL,7,Ftold she had a terminal brain tumour
OL,8,Fand months to live.
OL,10,FShe had not long met her partner and
OL,11,Fdreamed of a career in policing, but
OL,12,Fsuddenly the future was looking bleak.
OL,14,FThe diagnosis, by an experienced cancer
OL,15,Fconsultant, led to 11 years of
OL,16,Fchemotherapy treatment which changed
OL,17,Fher life. She regularly felt sick, she
OL,18,Fwas unable to take part in family
OL,19,Fevents, her career was curtailed and
OL,20,Fshe felt constantly "on eggshells".
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
